    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord</h2><br>We value your opinion, so if you have any feedback on the game, or if you need any help, feel free to join our Discord.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/4429475937da282f3732f587e58b87aa.avif?t=1695788886\" /></span><br>Smooth and detailed fighting scenes featuring brand new 3D modeling &amp; immersive experience into a fantasy world of animal chess pieces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/51b233874be4364b6f738e63f14209ae.avif?t=1695788886\" /></span><br>A game that can live up to every little bit of your imagination of auto chess. Easy to play, fast-paced, and strategy-oriented. There are even Runes, Hero DIY, and other new and well-designed elements, created all for your best experience!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/841801afcbc12badec8e06a6feb13e75.avif?t=1695788886\" /></span><br>A great number of Geos and different types allow you to adopt a wide range of strategies so that victory and defeat are instantly reversed following each and every move of yours on the battlefield! Whether it's the interplay of stats and special effects or the position arrangement of Geos, everything remains essential to victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/93dcc39e5cfe07e5934004ea39aa7760.avif?t=1695788886\" /></span><br>Come participate in the PvP modes, Match, Ranked, and Championship! The thrilling battles are always on! Do you dare to invite your friends to fight together and become the top auto-battler player?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.poster.avif?t=1695788886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.webm?t=1695788886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.mp4?t=1695788886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
