ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.poster.avif?t=1695788886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.webm?t=1695788886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512860/extras/80045a4e9911ce32163e4687477ce5be.mp4?t=1695788886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
